        "press_image_width_ratio": 40,
        "press_image_width": 300,
        "sub_title": "We are proud sponsors of Clean Miami Beach.",
        "letter_spacing_sub_title": "",
        "font_size_sub_title": 20,
        "font_size_sub_title_mb": 14,
        "margin_bottom_sub_title": 14,
        "font_weight_sub_title": "700",
        "sub_title_position": "sub_title_below",
        "color_sub_title": "#232323",
        "title": "About Clean Miami Beach",
        "title_font_size": 32,
        "title_font_size_mb": 20,
        "title_font_weight": "900",
        "mg_bottom_title": 0,
        "title_color": "#1c1d1b",
        "des": "<p>Clean Miami Beach is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization dedicated to protecting Miami Beach and its marine\nwildlife. Founded by local resident Sophie Ringel, the organization has grown from grassroots beach cleanups\ninto a city-wide movement focused on sustainability, environmental education, and community action.</p><p>\nThrough hands-on programs, in-school initiatives, and public events, Clean Miami Beach is making a lasting\nimpact on our coastal ecosystems and inspiring locals to take care of the place we call home..\n</p>",
        "des_font_size": 16,
